X:1
T:The Comforter Has Come
T:THE COMFORTER HAS COME
C:Music: William J. Kirkpatrick, 1890 · Words: Frank Bottome, 1890
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Pentecostal Hymns, No. 2" 1898 page 5. ABC file contributed to the Open Hymnal by Samuel Cantrell, 18 Jan 2012.. The hymnary.org score found for comparison (hymnary.org/tune/o_spread_the_tidings_round_kirkpatrick) is a different tune or version, so the melody follows the Open Hymnal's source.
